WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.204
OF THE TALLAHASSEE
BLACK REPUBLICANS.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.272
NOW, I'M PISSED!
all: MM-HMM.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.275
- ROYALLY PISSED!
all: MM-HMM.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:14.280
- LAST NOVEMBER, BARACK OBAMA
WAS RE-ELECTED PRESIDENT,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.449
AND THE BLACK VOTE
WENT ALMOST ENTIRELY TO HIM!

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.784
[crowd murmuring]
- DAGNABBIT.

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:22.655
- WE'RE NOT GETTING
OUR MESSAGE OUT, OBVIOUSLY.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:26.059
THE REPUBLICAN PARTY
IS AND SHOULD BE

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.661
THE ONLY HOME FOR BLACK VOTES.
- YES, SIR.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:32.665
- NOW, PEOPLE THINK THAT
BLACK VOTERS ARE A MONOLITH.

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.300
[scoffs]
WE'RE NOT A MONOLITH.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.935
- WHAT? WHAT?
- NO, WE'RE NOT.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.804
- IN FACT,
BLACK REPUBLICANS ALONE

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.672
ARE AN EXTREMELY DIVERSE
GROUP OF PEOPLE.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.440
[crowd murmuring agreement]

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.142
NOW, TO SPEAK MORE
ON DIVERSITY,

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:47.746
I PRESENT TONIGHT'S SPEAKER,

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:48.814
MR. DOUGLAS JACKSON.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:54.921
[applause]

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.795
[applause ends abruptly]

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.731
- NOW, I'M NOT GONNA
SUGARCOAT IT, I'M PISSED!

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:05.731
[crowd murmuring agreement]

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:08.034
I'M ROYALLY PISSED.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:11.170
THE LIBERAL MEDIA
THINKS THAT REPUBLICANISM

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.972
IS NOT FOR BLACK PEOPLE.
all: MM.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.242
- NOW, YOU TELL ME, WHAT
ABOUT FISCAL RESPONSIBILITY,

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.078
A STRONG NATIONAL DEFENSE,
AND A LIMITED GOVERNMENT

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:21.648
IS UNAPPEALING
TO BLACK PEOPLE?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.983
WE'RE NOT A MONOLITH!
all: MM-MMM.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.419
- WE COME IN ALL DIFFERENT
SHAPES AND SIZES.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.020
- WE DO.
all: MM-HMM!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.023
- NOW, WHO HERE WOULD LIKE
TO COME UP TO THIS PODIUM

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.725
AND SPEAK ABOUT THE DIVERSITY
AMONGST BLACK REPUBLICANS?

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:34.493
- [clears throat]

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.262
- OH.
[chuckles]

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.697
GENTLEMEN,
WE HAVE A REAL TREAT TODAY,

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.499
A GENTLEMAN
WHO IS A LITTLE BIT ECCENTRIC,

00:01:40.599 --> 00:01:44.303
A LITTLE BIT OUTSIDE OF THE BOX,
IF YOU WILL,

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.772
BUT I CAN'T THINK
OF A BETTER PERSON TO SPEAK

00:01:46.872 --> 00:01:49.275
ON DIVERSITY
AMONGST BLACK REPUBLICANS

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.376
THAN THIS GENTLEMAN
RIGHT HERE.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.078
ALL THE WAY FROM ORLANDO,
MY GOOD FRIEND,

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.512
ARTHUR WASHINGTON!

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:58.017
[applause]

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.385
IT'S GOOD TO SEE YOU.
IT'S GOOD TO SEE YOU.

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.520
GOOD TO SEE YOU, MAN.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.190
[applause]

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.258
[applause ends abruptly]

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.392
- THANK YOU
FOR THE INTRODUCTION,

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:07.559
BROTHER DOUGLAS.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.095
- THANK YOU FOR BEING HERE,
BROTHER ARTHUR.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.429
- MM-HMM.

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:13.232
HOWEVER, I AM...
PISSED.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:14.267
[crowd murmuring agreement]

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.968
ROYALLY PISSED.

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:17.236
- INDEED, INDEED!
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:18.537
- DEMOCRATS THINK
THEY HAVE THE RIGHT

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:20.339
TO ALL THE BLACK PEOPLE.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:21.708
BUT THAT IS NOT THE CASE.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:24.077
WE ARE NOT A MONOLITH.
[crowd murmuring agreement]

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:28.247
DEMOCRATS MAY BE COOL,
BUT THEY AIN'T PRACTICAL.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:29.415
- THERE YOU GO.
[crowd murmuring agreement]

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.384
- REPUBLICANS
ARE PRACTICAL.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:34.253
BLACK PEOPLE
ARE PRACTICAL!

00:02:34.353 --> 00:02:36.956
COME TO THINK OF IT...
- GET THOSE PANTS.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.425
- I THINK BLACK REPUBLICANS
ARE PRETTY COOL.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:40.660
[crowd murmuring agreement]
- HEAR, HEAR, HEAR, HEAR.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.328
- NOT TO MENTION
VERY DIVERSE.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.662
- THERE WE GO. MM-HMM.
[door opens]

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:46.231
- EXCUSE ME, GENTLEMEN.
SORRY TO INTERRUPT.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:49.035
SOMEONE'S WHITE WIFE
IS HERE TO PICK THEM UP.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:52.138
[all murmuring]

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.873
- WAS HER NAME EMILY?

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.909
- UH, SHE WAS WHITE.
- OH, GREAT, THAT'S--

